{"title":"Clamitious clod","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Clamitous Clod is a monster from <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Beast_Academy\" title=\"Beast Academy\">Beast Academy</a> who is constantly abducting <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Professor_Grok\" title=\"Professor Grok\">Professor Grok</a>. A common belief is that Clamitious Clod IS ALSO <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Professor_Grok\" title=\"Professor Grok\">Professor Grok</a> When one time <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Professor_Grok\" title=\"Professor Grok\">Professor Grok</a> was found in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ms._Levans\" title=\"Ms. Levans\">Ms. Levans</a> closet on the coat rack was Clamitious Clods cape.\n<i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Clamitious_clod&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018010713\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 286/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.211      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.211      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35954:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018010713 and revision id 285729. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}